### ==============================================================================
### FASE 7: DASHBOARD & REPORTING API SPECIFICATION (VS Code REST Client)
### ==============================================================================
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@testYear = 2027

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 0. AUTENTIKASI & CSRF
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 0.1 Ambil Token CSRF
# @name getCsrf
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/csrf

@csrfToken = {{getCsrf.response.body.csrf_token}}

### 0.2 Login sebagai Akuntansi (Akses Penuh Laporan & Dashboard)
# @name loginAkuntansi
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "email": "dya@ptcn.id",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 0.3 Login sebagai Manager (Akses Terbatas Unit Cakupan)
# @name loginManager
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "email": "budi@ptcn.id",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 0.4 Login sebagai PIC Unit (Akses Terbatas Unit Sendiri)
# @name loginPic
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "email": "rina@ptcn.id",
  "password": "password123"
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. DASHBOARD MONITORING ENDPOINTS
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 1.1 GET /api/dashboard/summary
# Ringkasan RKAP, Realisasi Pemakaian (Biaya & Investasi Dipisah), serta Ambang Peringatan
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/summary?company_id=1&period_id=1

### 1.2 GET /api/dashboard/progress
# Progres Pengisian Unit per Status Dokumen dan Daftar Unit Terlambat
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/progress?company_id=1&period_id=1

### 1.3 GET /api/dashboard/progress (Filter Jenis Dokumen Biaya)
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/progress?company_id=1&period_id=1&type=BIAYA

### 1.4 GET /api/dashboard/budget-vs-realization (Agregasi per COA)
# Drill-down RKAP vs Realisasi per COA beserta Level Ambang (ok, warning, critical)
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/budget-vs-realization?company_id=1&period_id=1&group_by=coa

### 1.5 GET /api/dashboard/budget-vs-realization (Agregasi per Unit)
# Drill-down RKAP vs Realisasi per Unit Kerja
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/budget-vs-realization?company_id=1&period_id=1&group_by=unit

### 1.6 GET /api/dashboard/budget-vs-realization (Agregasi per Barang Logistik)
# Drill-down RKAP vs Realisasi per Item Barang Logistik (jurnal pemakaian)
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/budget-vs-realization?company_id=1&period_id=1&group_by=item

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. LAPORAN ANGGARAN & KONSOLIDASI (REPORTS)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 2.1 GET /api/reports/expense-by-coa
# Rekapitulasi Anggaran Biaya per COA
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/expense-by-coa?company_id=1&period_id=1

### 2.2 GET /api/reports/investment-summary (Pengelompokan per Kategori)
# Ringkasan Anggaran Investasi per Kategori & Akun Penyusutan
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/investment-summary?company_id=1&period_id=1&group_by=category

### 2.3 GET /api/reports/investment-summary (Pengelompokan per Bulan Rencana)
# Ringkasan Anggaran Investasi per Bulan Rencana Pengadaan (Bulan 1 s.d. 12)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/investment-summary?company_id=1&period_id=1&group_by=month

### 2.4 GET /api/reports/consolidated
# Rekap Gabungan CN & CNH dengan Subtotal Unit, Subtotal Perusahaan, dan Grand Total
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/consolidated?period_year={{testYear}}&type=ALL

### 2.5 GET /api/reports/matrix (Default: hide_empty=true)
# Matriks Unit x COA dengan Kolom Terkelompok, Subtotal Instalasi, Perusahaan & Grand Total
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/matrix?period_year={{testYear}}&company_ids=1,2&hide_empty=true

### 2.6 GET /api/reports/matrix (Tampilkan Seluruh COA: hide_empty=false)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/matrix?period_year={{testYear}}&company_ids=1&hide_empty=false

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. EKSPOR LAPORAN EXCEL (.XLSX) VIA EXCELJS
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 3.1 Unduh Excel Rekap Gabungan Konsolidasi (.xlsx)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/export?report=consolidated&format=xlsx&period_year={{testYear}}

### 3.2 Unduh Excel Matriks Unit x COA (.xlsx)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/export?report=matrix&format=xlsx&period_year={{testYear}}

### 3.3 Unduh Excel Rekapitulasi Biaya per COA (.xlsx)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/export?report=expense-by-coa&format=xlsx&company_id=1&period_id=1

### 3.4 Unduh Excel Ringkasan Investasi (.xlsx)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/export?report=investment-summary&format=xlsx&company_id=1&period_id=1

### 3.5 Unduh Excel Budget vs Realization (.xlsx)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/export?report=budget-vs-realization&format=xlsx&company_id=1&period_id=1&group_by=coa

### 3.6 Permohonan Ekspor Format PDF (Ditolak Terjadwal 422 PDF_EXPORT_DEFERRED)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/export?report=consolidated&format=pdf&period_year={{testYear}}
